Note on third-party components:

- The WASM core embeds a t386 emulation of proprietary Yamaha DLLs
  (M5_EmuSmw5.dll / M5_EmuHw.dll) and the compressed preload image
  (ma5_ds.bin.z) originates from Yamaha SDK material. Redistribution and use
  of those embedded assets is subject to Yamaha's original terms.
- web/assets/ma5play.* are build artifacts of the above core.
- ref/ contains unmodified copies of the libymf825 reference sources used
  for A/B testing; see their respective headers for authorship.
